something, change its install year instead. Your 2026–2035 forecast Monthly reserve $2,684 Email me before these are due Idea Per unit, per month $224 Needed in 2026 $30,000 10-year total $162,800 The monthly reserve is the smallest steady amount that has the cash ready for every replacement from 2027 on, looking 30 years ahead. 2026 costs (overdue or due this year) are shown separately because there's no time to save for them. Replacement costs by year In today's dollars, no inflation. Big year ahead: Asphalt shingle roof and Gas furnace both come due in 2030: $88,400. The monthly reserve saves for it ahead of time. Replacement costs by year and category, 2026 to 2035 Year Total Roofing HVAC Plumbing Appliances Flooring Other 2026 $30,000 $0 $0 $16,800 $13,200 $0 $0 2027 $2,000 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $2,000 2028 $38,400 $0 $0 $0 $0 $38,400 $0 2029 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 2030 $88,400 $38,000 $50,400 $0 $0 $0 $0 2031 $2,000 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $2,000 2032 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 2033 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 2034 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 2035 $2,000 $0 $0 $0 $0 $0 $2,000 At risk Past end of life or within 2 years of it. Refrigerator (install year estimated) Past due since 2011 Tank water heater Due 2026 Parking lot seal coat Due 2027 Carpet Due 2028 What if we replace everything at risk now? Email me before these are due Idea What's due when Year Component Cost 2026 Tank water heater $16,800 2026 Refrigerator overdue (install year estimated) $13,200 2027 Parking lot seal coat $2,000 2028 Carpet $38,400 2030 Asphalt shingle roof $38,000 2030 Gas furnace $50,400 2031 Parking lot seal coat $2,000 2035 Parking lot seal coat $2,000 Download your forecast Download PDF Forecast spreadsheet (CSV) Download component list (Excel) Download component list (CSV) Condition report for lenders and buyers Idea"`;

