exports[`the forecast PDF for the example building in 2026 1`] = `"CAPEXCLOCK · CAPEX FORECAST Example building 12 units · 2026–2035 · prepared June 15, 2026 Monthly reserve $2,684 Per unit, per month $224 Needed in 2026 $30,000 10-year total $162,800 The monthly reserve is the smallest steady amount that has the cash ready for every replacement from 2027 on, looking 30 years ahead. 2026 costs (overdue or due this year) are listed separately. All figures are in today's dollars, without inflation. Big year ahead: Asphalt shingle roof and Gas furnace both come due in 2030: $88,400. The monthly reserve saves for it ahead of time. Replacement costs by year 2026 [bar 33.93665158371041%] $30,000 2027 [bar 2.262443438914027%] $2,000 2028 [bar 43.43891402714932%] $38,400 2029 $0 2030 [bar 100%] $88,400 2031 [bar 2.262443438914027%] $2,000 2032 $0 2033 $0 2034 $0 2035 [bar 2.262443438914027%] $2,000 At risk Refrigerator: 15 yrs past end of life (install year estimated) Tank water heater: due this year Parking lot seal coat: due in 1 yr Carpet: due in 2 yrs What's due when Year Component Qty Cost each Total Note 2026 Tank water heater 12 $1,400 $16,800 2026 Refrigerator 12 $1,100 $13,200 Overdue; Install year estimated 2027 Parking lot seal coat 8,000 sq ft $0.25/sq ft $2,000 2028 Carpet 9,600 sq ft $4/sq ft $38,400 2030 Asphalt shingle roof 1 $38,000 $38,000 2030 Gas furnace 12 $4,200 $50,400 2031 Parking lot seal coat 8,000 sq ft $0.25/sq ft $2,000 2035 Parking lot seal coat 8,000 sq ft $0.25/sq ft $2,000 Install year estimated: no install year was entered, so the building's year built is used. capexclock.com"`;

